编译server:

添加fltk的fluid工具到环境变量，
参考路径：c:\mywork\projects\cpp\vcpkg\installed\x64-mingw-static\tools\fltk

FL.H会引入windows.h，再配合asio.h使用会有冲突，使用cmake添加宏可解决：
NO_WINSOCK
WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN

serverluacoroutinerunner.cpp中使用类私有解态函数concatCode会导致gcc bug崩溃，把这个函数从类中提取出来解决。


Linux(ubuntu):
install packages below:
libx11-dev
libxext-dev
libwayland-dev
libasound2-dev
libasound2t64
注意使用vcpkg安装的SDL2可能默认不会启用alsa，也就是SDL_ALSA=OFF，需要手动改一下：
/home/kindred/mywork/projects/cpp/vcpkg/ports/sdl2/portfile.cmake在vcpkg_cmake_configure中添加-DSDL_ALSA=ON

sdl2-mixer默认不支持mp3，用vcpkg安装：
vcpkg install sdl2-mixer[mpg123]

for client debug:

--server-ip=127.0.0.1
--res-path=/home/kindred/mywork/projects/cpp/mir2x/cmake-build-debug/install/client/res
--input-script=/home/kindred/mywork/projects/cpp/mir2x/cmake-build-debug/install/client/script

pacman搜索：
pacman -Ss liblzo
pacman -S msys/liblzo2-devel

* windows安装linpinyin:
先用vs2022手动编译安装berkeleydb: git@github.com:kindred77/berkeleydb.git
再用vcpkg安装vcpkg install glib --triplet=x64-mingw-static
安装完成后编译libpinyin:
注释掉CMakeLists.txt中的find_package(BerkeleyDB)，然后：
cmake -G "Ninja" -DDB_FOUND=TRUE -DDB_INCLUDE_DIR=/home/kindred/software/berkeleydb/include -DDB_LIBRARIES=/home/kindred/software/berkeleydb/lib/libdb.a -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/home/kindred/software/libpinyin ..

cmake -G"Ninja" -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=c:/mywork/projects/cpp/vcpkg/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake -DVCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET=x64-mingw-static -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=c:/mywork/projects/cpp/libpinyin/install -DDB_FOUND=TRUE -DDB_INCLUDE_DIR=C:/mywork/projects/cpp/berkeleydb/build_windows -DDB_LIBRARIES=C:/mywork/projects/cpp/berkeleydb/build_windows/x64/Release

RIME测试:
rime可以在msys里安装
pacman -S mingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-marisa
pacman -S mingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-librime mingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-librime-data
pacman -Ql mingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-librime
rime也可以用mingw编译安装:
git clone git@github.com:kindred77/librime.git -b mingw_vcpkg_static
vcpkg install glog --triplet=x64-mingw-static
vcpkg install leveldb --triplet=x64-mingw-static
vcpkg install yaml-cpp --triplet=x64-mingw-static
vcpkg install googletest --triplet=x64-mingw-static
vcpkg install marisa-trie --triplet=x64-mingw-static
vcpkg install OpenCC --triplet=x64-mingw-static 1.1.9安装失败，升级到1.2.0，并且去掉enable-cpp17.patch这个补丁.
vcpkg install OpenCC --triplet=x64-mingw-static --editable
cmake -G "Ninja" -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=c:/mywork/projects/cpp/vcpkg/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake -DVCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET=x64-mingw-static -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=c:/mywork/projects/cpp/librime/install -DBUILD_TEST=OFF -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF -DBUILD_STATIC=ON -DENABLE_LOGGING=FALSE ..

